{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38086","headline":"八月六日作四首 一 · 韩偓","name":"八月六日作四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日离黄道十年昏，敏手重开造化门。\n火帝动炉销劒戟，风师吹雨洗乾坤。\n左牵犬马诚难测，右袒簪缨最负恩。\n丹笔不知谁定罪，莫留遗迹怨神孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}